# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your real values.
# .env.local is already gitignored — never commit real keys.
#
# Nothing here is required to run the app — src/lib/supabase.ts already has
# this project's real Supabase URL and publishable key baked in as defaults,
# and recipe generation / Pollee's chat run entirely client-side (see
# README.md "AI features"). Only set these to point a local checkout at a
# *different* Supabase project.

# From Supabase project settings -> API. Both are safe to expose to the
# browser (NEXT_PUBLIC_) — the publishable/anon key only has whatever access
# your Row Level Security policies grant it. See README.md for the "leads"
# table SQL.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
